<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="4e9a0bf1">&lt;p&gt;
    Connect with members of each change influencer network to confirm that they have started to actively meet with others
    to promote the adoption of the change through consistent messaging. Gather feedback on how the change is being received
    as it becomes available. Work with the network members to help address any concerns that are being raised in a timely
    manner.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
